  "content": "[Intro]\n[F]\n[C]\n[F]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[F]Some glad morning\nwhen this life is over\n[Bb]I'll fly a-\n[F]way\nTo that home on\nGod's celestial shore\nI'll [C]fly a-\n[F]way\n\n[Chorus]\n[F]I'll fly a-\nway, oh glory\n[Bb]I'll fly a-\n[F]way\nWhen I die Hallelu-\njah, by and by\nI'll [C]fly a-\n[F]way\n\n[Verse 2]\n[F]When the shadows\nof this life have gone\n[Bb]I'll fly a-\n[F]way\nLike a bird from\nprison bars has flown\nI'll [C]fly a-\n[F]way [Db]\n\n[Solo]\n[Gb]\n[Db]\n[Gb]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Gb]Just a few more\nweary days and then\n[B]I'll fly a-\n[Gb]way\nTo a land where\njoys will never end\nI'll [Db]fly a-\n[Gb]way\n\n[Chorus]\n[Gb]I'll fly a-\nway, oh glory\n[B]I'll fly a-\n[Gb]way\nWhen I die Hallelu-\njah, by and by\nI'll [Db]fly a-\n[Gb]way [D]\n\n[Chorus]\n[G]I'll fly a-\nway, oh glory\n[C]I'll fly a-\n[G]way\nWhen I die Hallelu-\njah, by and by\nI'll [D]fly a-\n[G]way",
